<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/amendment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Grant Amendment" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/amendment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A formally agreed change to an existing grant agreement's terms, budget, timeline, or amount, made after the original agreement was signed." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/amendment> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
