<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/application> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A grantee's formal submission requesting funding under a specific funding opportunity, including a proposal narrative and budget." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/application> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
