<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/approval-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Grant Term requiring authorization from the funder or another specified party before a defined change, expenditure, action, or deviation may occur (e.g., prior written approval for a budget reallocation above a threshold). Not automatically a Grant Condition -- an approval requirement may simply govern administration of the Award." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/approval-requirement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
