<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/authorized-signatory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they are authorized to sign a grant agreement or other governing document on behalf of an organization." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/authorized-signatory> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
