<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/award> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A funder's formal commitment to provide a specific amount of funding to a grantee, following an approved application or decision." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/award> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
