<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/board-member> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they serve on an organization's governing board." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/board-member> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
