<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/budget-modification> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "disbursement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/budget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
