<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Philanthropic Arrangement in which multiple funders pool resources into a shared Fund and jointly direct or oversee its grantmaking." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
