<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they provide paid, defined-scope services to an organization without being its employee." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contractor" .
