<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A recorded determination concerning an application following review or another authorized approval process. Its outcome (approved, declined, or approved with conditions) is carried by the decisionOutcome property, not by the Decision entity's identity itself." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
