<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor-Advised Fund Arrangement" .
