<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Philanthropic Arrangement in which a Donor Advisor holds non-binding advisory privileges over grants made from a Donor-Advised Fund." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "The specific privileges and limits granted to a donor advisor are set by the sponsoring organization's own policies and by tax law, not by this ontology -- consult counsel before using this model as a compliance reference." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor-Advised Fund" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "DAF" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Fund held by a sponsoring organization, over which a Donor Advisor holds non-binding privileges to recommend grants and investments." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "Donor-advised funds are subject to specific federal tax rules (e.g., IRC 4966-4967) governing what a donor advisor may and may not direct. This ontology models the general shape of the relationship, not compliance with those rules." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor Advisor" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they hold non-binding privileges to recommend grants and investments from a Donor-Advised Fund, typically as the fund's original donor." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "A donor advisor's privileges are non-binding as a matter of federal tax law, not just convention -- treating a recommendation as a binding instruction can jeopardize the sponsoring organization's tax-exempt status." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they contribute charitable funds to an organization or fund, without necessarily holding advisory privileges over how they are used." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/eligibility-criteria> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/eligibility-criteria> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/eligibility-criteria> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Eligibility Criteria" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/eligibility-criteria> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The conditions an organization or project must meet to apply to a funding opportunity." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/eligibility-criteria> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Employee" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they work for and are compensated by an organization." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employee> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Employer" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it employs a person -- the organization-side counterpart to that person's Employee role." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/employer> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evaluation" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured assessment of whether a grant-funded project achieved its intended outputs and outcomes." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evaluation> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence-claim> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence-claim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence-claim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evidence Claim" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence-claim> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sourced assertion about a relationship, condition, result, or causal interpretation whose evidentiary basis can be independently identified. This is where a specific interpretation of a Project's contribution to a Result -- association, contribution, attribution, or causation -- is represented, distinct from the Result itself and from the Evidence supporting the claim." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence-claim> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evidence" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Information used to support, weaken, qualify, or contextualize a claim about a Project, Activity, Result, or other entity (e.g., an evaluation report, survey results, administrative data, a case study)." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/evidence> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fiscal Sponsor" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it provides the legal and administrative infrastructure that lets another entity or project receive charitable funding on its behalf." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "Fiscal sponsorship arrangements vary significantly in legal structure (e.g., comprehensive/\"Model A\" vs. pre-approved grant relationship/\"Model C\"), which affects liability, employment, and asset ownership very differently. Consult counsel before relying on this model to characterize a specific arrangement." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fiscal Sponsorship Arrangement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Philanthropic Arrangement in which a Fiscal Sponsor accepts and administers charitable funds on behalf of a Sponsored Project that lacks independent legal status to receive them directly." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fiscal-sponsorship-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "The rights and obligations created by a fiscal sponsorship agreement depend heavily on its specific model (e.g., comprehensive vs. pre-approved grant relationship). Consult counsel and the actual governing agreement rather than this ontology." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fund" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A designated pool of financial resources set aside for a purpose, distinct from the grant program or strategy that directs how it's used." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Funder" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Grantmaker" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it provides funding to grantees through grant programs and awards." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funder> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-cycle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-cycle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-cycle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Funding Cycle" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-cycle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A recurring period (e.g., quarterly, annual) within a grant program during which applications are accepted and decided." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-cycle> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Funding Intermediary Role" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it channels funds between an original funding source and an ultimate grantee, without itself being the original funder or the final recipient." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Funding Opportunity" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "NOFO" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Notice of Funding Opportunity" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "RFP" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Request for Proposals" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A specific, time-bound invitation to apply for funding under a grant program, with defined eligibility, focus area, and deadlines." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-opportunity> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/geographic-area> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/geographic-area> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/geographic-area> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Geographic Area" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/geographic-area> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A geographic entity used to describe where a Need exists, where a Project operates, where a Population is located, or where a Result is observed." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/geographic-area> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-administrator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-administrator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-administrator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Administrator" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-administrator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-administrator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they are responsible for compliance, reporting, and financial management of an award on behalf of the grantee organization." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-administrator> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
