<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-agreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#award-and-agreement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-agreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Agreement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-agreement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The legal document, signed by both funder and grantee, that formalizes an award's terms, conditions, and obligations." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-agreement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-condition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#award-and-agreement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Condition" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Grant Term establishing a barrier, milestone, event, requirement, or other criterion that must be satisfied for grant entitlement, payment, continuation, release, or retention. Matching Requirement and Payment Condition are its existing concrete subtypes. A condition's barrier facts (e.g. hasBarrier, threshold) are captured here without the ontology itself making the accounting or legal determination of whether the grant is \"conditional\"." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-condition> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-lifecycle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-lifecycle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#cross-cutting> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-lifecycle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Lifecycle" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-lifecycle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The end-to-end sequence a grant moves through, from funding opportunity through application, review, award, disbursement, reporting, and closeout." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-lifecycle> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "cross-cutting" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Program" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A funder's standing area of giving (e.g., \"Environmental Justice Grants\"), under which funding opportunities are issued over time." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#application-and-review> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Recommendation" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Donor Advisor's non-binding request that a Donor-Advised Fund make an award to a specific recipient; the fund's sponsoring organization retains final authority to accept or decline it." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "A Grant Recommendation's non-binding status is a legal requirement for donor-advised funds under federal tax law, not a design choice -- see Donor-Advised Fund and Donor Advisor." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#award-and-agreement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Term" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A provision associated with a Grant Agreement or Award that establishes a restriction, condition, obligation, approval requirement, reporting requirement, or other requirement governing the use, administration, performance, or continuation of grant funding. Preserves its original source wording (via originalTermText) alongside its normalized classification -- the classification is an interpretation of the source text, not a replacement for it." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grantee" .
