<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/impact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/result> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/impact> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A broader or longer-term change to which one or more Outcomes may contribute. An Impact relationship does not itself imply that the Project has been demonstrated to cause the change." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/impact> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indicator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Indicator" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A defined measure used to assess the state or change of a Result (e.g., percentage of participants employed after six months, graduation rate)." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indicator> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indirect-cost-rate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indirect-cost-rate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#compliance-and-reporting> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indirect-cost-rate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Indirect Cost Rate" .
