<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/installment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A single scheduled portion of an award's total funds, to be disbursed at a defined point or upon meeting a condition." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/installment> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "disbursement" .
