<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/letter-of-inquiry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A brief, preliminary submission used by some funders to screen interest before inviting a full application." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/letter-of-inquiry> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
