<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/logic-model> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/logic-model> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Logic Model" .
