<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/matching-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A condition requiring the grantee to raise or contribute additional funds alongside the award, often as a ratio (e.g., 1:1 match)." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/matching-requirement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/measurement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/measurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/measurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Measurement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/measurement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An observed value for an Indicator at a particular time and, where relevant, for a defined Population or Geographic Area. Never treated as interchangeable with a Target: a Target is planned, a Measurement is observed." .
