<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/need> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/need> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Need" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/need> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A condition, problem, gap, or opportunity identified as warranting intervention or investment." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/need> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
