<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A contextual capacity an organization occupies within a specific arrangement or award -- such as acting as a funder, grant recipient, or fiscal sponsor -- rather than a permanent trait of the organization itself." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organization Type" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The legal and tax classification of what an organization fundamentally is (e.g., a public charity, private foundation, or government entity), independent of any role it plays in a specific relationship." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-type> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organization" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/agent> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Any legal entity participating in grantmaking or philanthropy. An organization occupies one or more contextual roles (see Organization Role) rather than being permanently classified as a funder or a recipient." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/outcome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/outcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/outcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Outcome" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/outcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/result> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/outcome> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A change in condition, behavior, knowledge, capacity, practice, or status that is intended or observed in association with a Project or Activity, distinct from a direct Output. A recorded Outcome does not by itself establish that the Project caused it -- see Evidence Claim for how a specific causal or contributory interpretation is represented and evidenced." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/outcome> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/output> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/output> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/output> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Output" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/output> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/result> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/output> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A direct product, service, deliverable, or immediate consequence of Activities carried out by a Project (e.g., number of workshops held, people served). Does not itself imply any broader behavioral or social change." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/output> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/partner> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/partner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/partner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Partner" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/partner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/partner> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it collaborates with another organization on shared work, in a relationship not adequately described as one party purchasing from or providing a service to the other." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/partner> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/payment-condition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/payment-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#disbursement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/payment-condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Payment Condition" .
