<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A natural person who participates in nonprofit, philanthropic, governance, employment, advisory, or service relationships." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
