<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Philanthropic Arrangement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured relationship among organizations that channels philanthropic funding outside a direct funder-to-grantee award -- such as a fiscal sponsorship or donor-advised fund arrangement." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-intermediary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-intermediary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-intermediary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Philanthropic Intermediary" .
