<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-intermediary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organization commonly known for facilitating philanthropy on behalf of others -- such as by re-granting, fiscal sponsorship, or hosting donor-advised funds -- regardless of which specific role it occupies in a given arrangement." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-intermediary> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
