<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/properties/terms-and-conditions-restriction-type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether the funding governed by these Terms and Conditions is Restricted or Unrestricted Funding. A coarse flag, superseded for new data by one or more structured Use Restriction Grant Terms (see grant-term), which can express what specifically the funding is restricted to or from -- retained here for backward compatibility." .
