<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/properties/use-restriction-restriction-mode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether this restriction requires a use, merely permits it, or prohibits it. An Award may carry more than one Use Restriction with different modes (e.g. a required-use restriction to a project, and a separate prohibited-use restriction on lobbying)." .
