<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/claim-type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "How strong an interpretation an Evidence Claim makes about a Project's relationship to a Result -- deliberately distinct, ordered from weakest to strongest evidentiary interpretation, and never treated as equivalent to one another." .
