<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Fund's accounting restriction status -- whether its use is constrained by the donor, and if so, how. `donor-restricted` is the broader designation covering both time-limited and perpetual donor restrictions; `temporarily-restricted` and `permanently-restricted` narrow it to which kind." .
