<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/use-restriction-type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The nature of what a Use Restriction limits grant funds to (or from) -- distinct from Fund's own restriction-type scheme, which describes a Fund's accounting restriction status rather than the specific nature of a grant term's use restriction. Values do not all carry identical legal significance." .
