<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/advises> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Donor Advisor advises a specific Donor-Advised Fund, holding non-binding privileges to recommend its grants and investments." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/advises> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> .
