<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/affiliatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Person is affiliated with an Organization, independent of which specific Person Role(s) they occupy there." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/affiliatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person> .
