<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/agentPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Agent (Person or Organization) plays one or more Roles. The preferred predicate for new data now that Agent exists as a shared superclass, replacing the separate playsRole (Organization) and personPlaysRole (Person) predicates -- both kept and still valid on existing data, not migrated, per this project's policy of never deleting or force-migrating published predicates." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/agentPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/agent> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/agentPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/08-organizations-roles-and-arrangements.md> .
