<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/appliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Organization Role is scoped to the Philanthropic Arrangement it was granted within, so the same organization can hold different roles in different arrangements." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/appliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/appliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/08-organizations-roles-and-arrangements.md> .
