<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/organizationRoleAppliesWithinOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/organizationRoleAppliesWithinOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Organization Role can also be scoped directly to an Organization rather than an Arrangement -- e.g. a Contractor, Vendor, Service Provider, Employer, or Partner role is naturally scoped to which organization it relates to, not to a Philanthropic Arrangement. A distinct predicate from rel-organization-role-applies-within for the same reason Phase 3.7 Milestone 1's Person relationships needed distinct names: the generator requires every relationship predicate to be globally unique, so one predicate can't have two different declared object concepts. Broadening this into a true Role-appliesWithin-Context union (Award, Application, Agreement, Fund, Grant Program, Funding Opportunity, Project, Review, Payment, Decision, per the Phase 3.7 roadmap) is deferred until real worked-example data actually needs one of those specific contexts -- adding all of them speculatively now, each as its own distinct predicate, would be exactly the kind of premature abstraction this project avoids." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/organizationRoleAppliesWithinOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/organizationRoleAppliesWithinOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/08-organizations-roles-and-arrangements.md> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/organizationRoleAppliesWithinOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applies within" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/organizationRoleAppliesWithinOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/participatesIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/participatesIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Organization participates in a Philanthropic Arrangement, independent of tracking which specific role it occupies there." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/participatesIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/participatesIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/08-organizations-roles-and-arrangements.md> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/participatesIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "participates in" .
