<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/agentPlaysRole> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Person plays one or more Person Roles, each a contextual, independently-scoped occupancy rather than a permanent trait -- mirroring how an Organization plays Organization Roles (rel-organization-plays-role). A distinct predicate rather than a shared `playsRole` because the generator requires every relationship predicate to be globally unique (one fixed subject/object concept pair each); broadening `playsRole` into a real Person-or-Organization union predicate is a generator change deferred to when it's actually needed." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "plays" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Person Role is scoped to the Organization it was granted within. This is the minimal case needed to make Person Role usable; broadening it to Award, Application, Agreement, and other contexts (matching how Organization Role's own context is broadened) is Phase 3.7 Milestone 2's job -- which will also need to resolve the same predicate-uniqueness constraint noted on personPlaysRole above, likely by generalizing the generator to support a shared predicate across a union of object concepts." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applies within" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/playsRole> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/agentPlaysRole> .
