<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/playsRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Organization plays one or more Organization Roles, each a contextual, independently-scoped occupancy rather than a permanent trait." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/playsRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> .
