<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/report> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A grantee's submission to the funder describing progress, outcomes, and/or use of funds, per the reporting schedule. Narrative and financial reports are common subtypes." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/report> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "compliance-and-reporting" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#award-and-agreement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reporting Requirement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Grant Term requiring submission of information concerning grant activities, finances, progress, outputs, outcomes, compliance, or closeout. Finer-grained than a Reporting Schedule (which sets the overall cadence for an award): one clause such as \"quarterly programmatic and financial reports are required\" normalizes into two Reporting Requirements, one per report type, each of which may be fulfilledBy a submitted Report." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-requirement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-schedule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-schedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#compliance-and-reporting> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-schedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reporting Schedule" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-schedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-schedule> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The agreed cadence and due dates for narrative and financial reports over the life of an award." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reporting-schedule> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "compliance-and-reporting" .
