<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/review-criteria> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#application-and-review> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Review" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/review> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The process of evaluating an application, producing a recommendation and often a score, conducted by one or more reviewers." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/review> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
