<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reviewer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they evaluate an application against review criteria, whether as staff, a board member, or an external peer reviewer." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reviewer> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
