<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-compliance-requirement-attaches-to-award> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Compliance Requirement is always attached to a specific Award, not to the Grantee in the abstract -- the same organization can be in good standing on one award and delinquent on another." .
