<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-compliance-requirement-attaches-to-award> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/award> .
