<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An instance of a Person Role must be held by a Person (via playsRole); an instance of an Organization Role must be held by an Organization (via playsRole). A role occupancy with no holder is not a valid occupancy, only a role definition." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
