<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/target> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/target> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Target" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/target> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A planned value for an Indicator expected to be reached by a defined point in time." .
