<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/terms-and-conditions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Terms and Conditions" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/terms-and-conditions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The specific obligations, restrictions, and expectations attached to an award (e.g., allowable uses of funds, reporting requirements). Its own restrictionType property is a coarse restricted/unrestricted flag, superseded for new data by the structured Use Restriction model (see Grant Term) -- retained for backward compatibility." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/terms-and-conditions> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
