<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/theory-of-change> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/theory-of-change> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Theory of Change" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/theory-of-change> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A grantee's or funder's articulated model of how specific activities are expected to lead to desired long-term change." .
