<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/unrestricted-funding> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Funding a grantee may use at its discretion in support of its general mission. Deprecated: prefer Fund's restrictionType property, backed by the restriction-type reference scheme, for new data -- retained for backward compatibility." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/unrestricted-funding> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
