<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/use-restriction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#award-and-agreement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/use-restriction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Use Restriction" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/use-restriction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-term> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/use-restriction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Grant Term limiting the purposes, activities, populations, geographies, time periods, cost categories, or other uses for which grant resources may be applied. Governs permitted use -- distinct from a Grant Condition, which governs whether some entitlement, payment, or continuation becomes effective." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/use-restriction> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "award-and-agreement" .
