<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/vendor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it is the source from which another organization purchases standard goods or services, without a defined-work contract the way a Contractor has." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/vendor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
